        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "SGQZC",
          "name": "Icon usage note",
          "width": 1200,
          "height": 200,
          "content": "Primitive / Icon — Pattern A (Pencil-native lucide) per Q4 probe (supersedes D-25 fallback). Four size variants: 16, 20, 24, 32. Default glyph: chevron-right. CONSUMERS OVERRIDE THE GLYPH via descendants override on a `ref` of the size variant, OR by inserting a fresh `type: icon, library: lucide, icon: \"<name>\"` node. Approved glyphs (source-driven per D-26): arrow-left, arrow-right, check, menu, search, chevron-down, chevron-right, moon, alert-circle, link. Brand glyphs (linkedin, twitter, instagram, substack) DEFERRED to Phase 25 per D-28."
        },
