        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "iypPb",
          "name": "Compound / Card — slot signature",
          "width": 1200,
          "height": 680,
          "content": "Compound / Card (reusable, id t40xct) — slot signature:\n\n• image-slot (id FGdti) — slot:[] (untyped), enabled:true. Default: light-gray placeholder rectangle (180h fill_container, fill #f2f2f7ff color-semantic-bg-surface-elevated) with 'Image' text label. Consumers populate with type:image fill on the slot or replace with custom image-bearing node at instance time. Set enabled:false for Service-style cards with no image.\n\n• title-slot (id vGH3A) — slot:[] (untyped), enabled:true. Default: 'Card title' text (Plus Jakarta Sans 18/700 navy color-semantic-text-primary). Consumers override the text content via descendants. Suitable for any single-line or wrapping title.\n\n• body-slot (id oTSwn) — slot:[] (untyped), enabled:true. Default: body filler text (Inter 14/normal #52525bff color-semantic-text-secondary, lineHeight 1.625, fill_container width). Consumers replace with description (Service card), excerpt + category meta (Blog card), or date + result metric (Project card).\n\n• footer-actions-slot (id eNqxd) — slot:['M7eUr','hIWuC'] (TYPED suggestion per D-52 PREFERRED — Pencil's slot array IS suggestion-only per Pencil schema 2.13 + guidelines § 2; non-matching insertion is not enforced, but typed slots provide picker discoverability). Default: Primitive/Button/Default ref with 'Read More' label + iconTrailing arrow-right wired. Consumers override label/icon or replace with a different Button variant (e.g., Secondary outline for de-emphasized cards). Set enabled:false for Blog-style cards with no explicit CTA.\n\nCard width 320 (typical library preview; consumers resize via fill_container at instance time in card grids). Padding 24 per Pencil guidelines § 12 'Inside cards'. Border 1px #d4d4d8ff color-semantic-border-default + cornerRadius 10 radius-semantic-card.\n\nProvenance: RASTER-DERIVED per D-49 (Plan 25-03 Task 1 raster-probe inference from design/images/image-import-12.jpg + image-import-14.jpg — Service / Project / Blog card patterns). v1.3 src/components/ui/Card.astro consulted as SECONDARY structural reference only; visual values are token-driven, NOT v1.3 neobrutalist visuals (Pitfall 2 prevention).\n\nSource-coverage gap: tracked as OPEN-25-07 (severity notable; consumer phase 28 Blog or 29 Projects). First concrete Card consumer locks the real values via instance overrides or component edits and resolves the flag. Follows Phase 24 OPEN-24-12 (Badge) consumer-resolution precedent.\n\nNO Card hover/focus states ship in Phase 25 — Crito raster doesn't depict; primitive-layer Button hover/focus inside footer-actions-slot covers interactivity.\n\nSee 25-03-SUMMARY.md and PEN-INVENTORY § Variant Evidence (Phase 24) Phase-25-plan-03 rows + § Compound Source Inference (Phase 25) section for full audit trail."
        },
        {
