        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "TXLkH",
          "name": "Compound / CheckboxGroup — slot signature",
          "width": 1200,
          "height": 0,
          "content": "Compound / CheckboxGroup (reusable) — slot signature:\n\n• legend-slot (text, body-sm typography, REQUIRED — group-level prompt like HTML <legend>; Inter 14/normal #141f39ff). Plan 27-02 Solutions field instance overrides to 'How can Joel help?' per D-97.\n\n• options-slot (frame, vertical-stack gap 12, typed suggestion: Primitive/Checkbox/Default refs gimNt per D-52 PREFERRED + sibling-note belt-and-suspenders; enabled:true with 3 placeholder Checkbox refs per Phase 25 D-53 enabled-with-placeholder). Plan 27-02 Contact Solutions field instance overrides options-slot contents to 5 Checkbox refs with v1.3 labels: AI / Automations / Web Apps / Consultation / Not Sure per D-97. Horizontal layout possible if cl8tt raster probe reveals different shape — but default vertical per Claude's Discretion (v1.3 space-y-3 observation).\n\n• helper-slot (text, body-sm secondary, OPTIONAL — enabled:false default per Phase 25 D-53 enabled-with-placeholder pattern).\n\nNo per-option legend (legend-slot is group-level). D-89 Hybrid library strategy — CheckboxGroup composes Checkbox refs (distinct from Compound/Card which composes images + text via slots).\n\nSee 27-00-SUMMARY.md and PEN-INVENTORY § Variant Evidence (Phase 27) for full audit trail."
        }
