          "name": "Section / CTA — slot signature",
          "width": 1200,
          "height": 0,
          "content": "Section / CTA (reusable) — slot signature:\n\n• headline-slot — slot:[] (untyped), enabled:true. Default: 'Still have questions?' text (Plus Jakarta Sans 32/700/lh 1.4 navy — heading-2 typography). Consumers override via descendants for headline microcopy.\n\n• body-slot — slot:[] (untyped), enabled:true. Default: prose body placeholder (Inter 16/400 #52525bff). Optional — consumers may set enabled:false for headline-only CTAs.\n\n• actions-slot — slot:['M7eUr','hIWuC'] (TYPED suggestion per D-52 PREFERRED Pattern). Default: 1 Primitive/Button/Default ref with 'Get in touch' label + iconTrailing slot enabled (consumer wires arrow-right at instance time per D-44 carry-forward). Consumers may add 2nd Button/Secondary ref for dual-CTA.\n\nWidth 1200 fixed (matches Header/Footer Phase 25 ship width). Padding [64,0] (section-y rhythm — binds to space-semantic-section-y). Fill #f2f2f7ff binds to color-semantic-bg-surface-elevated. Gap 24 binds to space-semantic-stack-md.\n\nFAQ instances as 'Still have questions?' CTA with STUB microcopy per D-82 (real wording deferred to future content phase). Phase 31 Homepage may instance for hero / footer / mid-page CTAs.\n\nSee 26-00-SUMMARY.md and PEN-INVENTORY § Variant Evidence (Phase 26) for full audit trail."
        },
