          "height": 0,
          "content": "Section / NavBack (reusable) — slot signature:\n\n• heading-slot — slot:[] (untyped), enabled:true. Default: 'Find what you need' text (Plus Jakarta Sans 32/700/lh 1.4 navy — heading-2 typography). Consumers override via descendants.\n\n• links-slot — slot:[] (untyped), enabled:true. Default: 4 text-node children with body typography (Inter 16/400 navy lh 1.625), contents: Home, Blog, Projects, Contact (Joel's v1.3 nav set per CONTEXT Claude's Discretion). PLAIN TEXT NODES — NOT Button refs per Pitfall O5/O6 narrow-scope design.\n\nWidth 1200 fixed. Padding [32,0]. Gap 16 (heading→links) + gap 24 (between links). Layout vertical at root; links-slot is horizontal.\n\nBuilt narrowly for 404 only (D-79). NOT generalized to Blog 'related posts' / Projects 'related projects' — those need card-grid shapes, different signature, deferred to Phase 28/29.\n\n404 instances with default labels (Joel-v1.3-nav-set, structural not microcopy). Real nav link targets wired by code milestone.\n\nSee 26-00-SUMMARY.md and PEN-INVENTORY § Variant Evidence (Phase 26) for full audit trail."
