                  "content": "Absolutely. Most client communication happens over video calls and email. Location doesn't matter.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.625,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
